+//   (1) detector confirms a freed-while-live victim at the clone read (map.v);
+//   (2) vgc_hf_enqueue records (victim, K_live, reading-cache-idx) into a bounded
+//       ring — read-time, ~0 cost, no scan;
+//   (3) at the NEXT GC, IN-STW post-sweep (world frozen ⇒ memory stable ⇒ scanning
+//       stacks/arena/anon is race-free), vgc_hf_drain runs a BOUNDED, word-budgeted
+//       search for K_live's address across: 3a other reactor stacks (reading thread
+//       EXCLUDED — the read-spray contamination), 3b in-use scannable arena spans,
+//       3c private-anon (mach_vm_region, per-victim not per-GC). vgc's OWN diagnostic
+//       globals are excluded (prior pollution).
